  - Target: HEALTH CARE PROVIDER
  - Description: A health care provider may perform a physical exam
  - Source: HEALTH CARE PROVIDER
  - Target: PHYSICAL EXAM
  - Description: A health care provider is responsible for performing the physical exam, during which vital signs are also checked. The physical exam is carried out by the health care provider as part of the assessment process.
