  - Source: GENERAL HEALTH TESTS
  - Target: PHYSICAL EXAM
  - Description: GENERAL HEALTH TESTS encompass a range of routine medical evaluations, and PHYSICAL EXAM is one of the key components included within them. In other words, a physical exam is one of the general health tests performed to assess overall health.
