      <data key="d1">NATIONAL CANCER INSTITUTE</data>
      <data key="d2">extracted</data>
      <data key="d3">The National Cancer Institute (NCI) is a U.S. organization listed as a resource for finding cancer clinical trials. It is an authoritative source for locating clinical trials available in the United States, with its resource available at cancer.gov. 
**Relationships:**
