  - Source: STEM CELL RESCUE
  - Target: STEM CELL REMOVAL
  - Description: Stem cell removal is the first step of a stem cell rescue
  - Source: HIGH-DOSE CHEMOTHERAPY
  - Target: STEM CELL REMOVAL
  - Description: Stem cells are removed and stored before high-dose chemotherapy is given during a stem cell rescue
  - Source: STEM CELL REMOVAL
  - Target: STEM CELL REPLACEMENT
