  - Description: When cancer has spread beyond the cervix, a hysterectomy is not performed; instead, lymph nodes may be removed for staging.
  - Source: PATHOLOGIC STAGING
  - Target: LYMPH NODE REMOVAL
  - Description: Pathologic staging may examine a lymph node removed during surgery.
  - Source: LYMPH NODE REMOVAL
