      <data key="d11">The National Comprehensive Cancer Network (NCCN) offers patient education materials that describe immunotherapy as a type of systemic therapy. In its patient guidelines, NCCN provides detailed information on immunotherapy, including its side effects and the use of checkpoint inhibitors.</data>
