      <data key="d9">related_to</data>
      <data key="d10">1.0</data>
      <data key="d11">The NCCN (National Comprehensive Cancer Network) provides patient-focused guidelines specifically addressing melanoma. These NCCN Guidelines for Patients are designed to offer accessible information about the disease, its management, and related care. In addition, the source material directs readers to these NCCN Guidelines for Patients as a recommended resource for further details on melanoma, reinforcing their role as a key reference for patient education and guidance.</data>
      <data key="d12">MELANOMA</data>
    </edge>
