    <edge source="SMOKEFREE.GOV" target="CANCER TREATMENT" id="related_to">
      <data key="d7">SMOKEFREE.GOV</data>
      <data key="d8">CANCER TREATMENT</data>
      <data key="d9">related_to</data>
      <data key="d10">1.0</data>
      <data key="d11">Stopping smoking or vaping is essential to maximize the chance of cure and minimize side effects from cancer treatment; SmokeFree.gov is an online resource to help quit.</data>
      <data key="d12">SMOKEFREE.GOV</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="BETOBACCOFREE.GOV" target="CDC" id="related_to">
      <data key="d7">BETOBACCOFREE.GOV</data>
      <data key="d8">CDC</data>
      <data key="d9">related_to</data>
      <data key="d10">1.0</data>
      <data key="d11">BeTobaccoFree.gov and the Centers for Disease Control and Prevention (CDC) are both recognized as online support resources for individuals seeking to quit tobacco use. Specifically, the CDC provides these resources through its dedicated website, CDC.gov/tobacco. Together, BeTobaccoFree.gov and the CDC serve as accessible online support options to help people quit smoking or vaping. Both entities are listed as credible sources of assistance for tobacco cessation, offering guidance and resources for those looking to stop using tobacco products.</data>
      <data key="d12">BETOBACCOFREE.GOV</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="BETOBACCOFREE.GOV" target="CDC.GOV/TOBACCO" id="related_to">
      <data key="d7">BETOBACCOFREE.GOV</data>
      <data key="d8">CDC.GOV/TOBACCO</data>
      <data key="d9">related_to</data>
      <data key="d10">1.0</data>
      <data key="d11">BeTobaccoFree.gov and CDC.gov/tobacco are both online support websites designed to help individuals quit smoking or vaping. They are recommended smoking cessation support resources and are frequently listed together in guidance as trusted online options for quitting tobacco use. Both websites serve as accessible, evidence-based quit-smoking and quit-vaping support tools, often cited side by side for individuals seeking help with nicotine addiction.</data>
      <data key="d12">BETOBACCOFREE.GOV</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="BETOBACCOFREE.GOV" target="QUITTING SMOKING" id="related_to">
